# Generated binaries and artifacts -- regenerated every run, no consumer.
# Screenshots are captured by visual_fingerprint.py for perceptual hashing;
# the hashing works from the in-memory image, and nothing reads the JPEGs back
# (not the frontend, not generate_evidence.py). Filenames are {domain}.jpg with
# no timestamp, so rescans overwrite and they never formed an evidence archive.
# 23,506 tracked files across the two directories were ~1.1 GB of the repo.
data/screenshots/
docs/data/screenshots/

# CI debug logs captured from workflow runs
logs/
